# CQ8 - For a given phase-equilibrium or devitrification-kinetics simulation:
#        which thermodynamic model does it use, and which measured data were
#        specified inputs of the CALPHAD assessment that produced that model?
#
# PATH:   simulation (go:GO_0000307 phase equilibrium calculation OR go:GO_0000304
#         devitrification kinetics simulation, subclass closure)
#         --obo:OBI_0000293--> thermodynamic model INSTANCE (go:GO_0000316);
#         CALPHAD assessment (go:GO_0000308) --obo:OBI_0000299--> the same model;
#         assessment --obo:OBI_0000293--> measurement datum (obo:IAO_0000109).
# MEASURED VS SIMULATED: assessment inputs are required to be typed obo:IAO_0000109
#         (measurement datum) - measured data used as model parameters; simulated data
#         play no input role in this pattern.
# EXPECTED RESULT COLUMNS:
#         ?simulation ?simClass - the thermochemical computation and its class
#         ?thermoModel          - the thermodynamic model individual
#         ?assessment           - the CALPHAD assessment occurrence
#         ?measDatum            - measured datum used as assessment input
# EXPECTED ROW COUNT on the 2.0.0-rc1 package: 1 - the single illustrative
#         devitrification-kinetics chain.
# GRAPH ASSUMPTION: answers are computed on the ASSERTED graph only - rdfs:subClassOf*
#         traverses asserted subclass axioms; no OWL reasoning (including
#         owl:equivalentClass-based classification) is required or claimed. A reasoner
#         may widen the answer set; the expected count below refers to the asserted union.
# SEMANTIC LIMITATION: the thermochemical branch (GO_0000303/304/307/308/316) is a minimal
#         branch grounded in the GlasAgent project documents (thermodynamic models, CALPHAD
#         optimisation, devitrification kinetics, measured data as model parameters)
#         rather than in the screened literature corpus, and it awaits validation by the
#         designated domain experts. The A-Box fixture for this query is SYNTHETIC and
#         value-free: no thermochemical value is asserted, and nothing in it is a
#         screened-corpus or project simulation result.
# VALIDATION: executed for the presentation-stage 2.0.0-rc1 package against the asserted
#         union of go_v2_candidate.ttl and the synthetic abox_meltquench_example.ttl
#         (Apache Jena arq and RDFLib, identical results).
PREFIX rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX obo:  <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/>
PREFIX go:   <https://w3id.org/pmd/glass-ontology/>

SELECT DISTINCT ?simulation ?simClass ?thermoModel ?assessment ?measDatum
WHERE {
  VALUES ?simRoot { go:GO_0000307 go:GO_0000304 }

  ?simulation rdf:type ?simClass .
  ?simClass   rdfs:subClassOf* ?simRoot .

  ?simulation obo:OBI_0000293 ?thermoModel .                # has specified input
  ?thermoModel rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* go:GO_0000316 .    # thermodynamic model

  ?assessment obo:OBI_0000299 ?thermoModel .                # assessment produced the model
  ?assessment rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* go:GO_0000308 .     # CALPHAD assessment process

  ?assessment obo:OBI_0000293 ?measDatum .                  # measured data as model parameters
  ?measDatum  rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* obo:IAO_0000109 .   # measurement datum
}
ORDER BY ?simulation ?thermoModel ?measDatum
